    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/36add832002471f77da8e567d5a6092f.avif?t=1687378097\" /></div><br><br><strong>Edemn</strong> is a fun and dynamic shooter about skeletons who have risen through ancient magic and now fight among themselves. The game is done in the style of games from the early 2000s, which creates a cool atmosphere to play<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/a80569a8d3a173abdf0c1079227ab958.poster.avif?t=1687378097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/a80569a8d3a173abdf0c1079227ab958.webm?t=1687378097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/a80569a8d3a173abdf0c1079227ab958.mp4?t=1687378097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/FS_Chalenge.png?t=1687378097\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/cf5fe5a38bdccacb71e1d226c6e582d9.webp?t=1687378097\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You will have to fight with other players, for the victory with different types of weapons. Each match in Edemn will be varied, and will drag on for a long time.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/4bc4da2b3fae14f52cc67d7b42690817.poster.avif?t=1687378097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/4bc4da2b3fae14f52cc67d7b42690817.webm?t=1687378097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/4bc4da2b3fae14f52cc67d7b42690817.mp4?t=1687378097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/e35e1758bb8269fab976aa88f28bc0dc.webp?t=1687378097\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each of which is unique, will diversify your game experience and add new abilities to your skeleton.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/8276cda1b5e2c6bcf25625868781e663.poster.avif?t=1687378097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/8276cda1b5e2c6bcf25625868781e663.webm?t=1687378097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/8276cda1b5e2c6bcf25625868781e663.mp4?t=1687378097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/6444c5d099761b542651e5df5347e47b.webp?t=1687378097\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Can completely change the style of the game, each skin has a different ability, which distinguishes it from other skeletons.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/d7cd1c3fa2931ea2ccbf46cf6e39fd23.poster.avif?t=1687378097\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219660/extras/d7cd1c3fa2931ea2ccbf46cf6e39fd23.webm?t=1687378097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sha